  "blurb": "The woodwork slice of buildShelf, as it stands after #313. The species is resolved here and nowhere else, which is the whole of the menu's laziness: an entry nobody selects is never fetched. Read the effects ledger against the PR's own request table. Flip Layer to Tests and exactly two nodes move: bindSheet and applyWoodFibre each take a parameter with a real default, so a double goes in at the call. fibreMapFor keeps canvas 2d, because it has no seam and no vitest spec reaches it — only smoke:render does, in a real browser with nothing substituted.",
